# behavior: Inline comments stay on their statement, conditionals and loops receive canonical spacing, long for, if let and match headers wrap into parseable grouped layouts, and a long and/or header puts one operand per line inside parentheses, with a nested group on one line when it fits and in its own block when it does not.
